  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthy snacks allow kids a better education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Educar y Crecer we work to strengthen the education of  500 children from vulnerable contexts in Argentina in 11 Student Learning Centers with innovative and effective educational programs.   Still, due to worsened socio-economic conditions, we have found the need to supplement the nutrition of our students, as many have manifested to eat only once a day. Thus, we provide them with healthy snacks that include fruit and superfoods, specially designed to cater for children&apos;s nutritional needs.</narrative>
  </description>
